:: Bailey Monogamy [widget]
<<widget "baileyMonogamyOptions">>
	<<if $syndromeBailey and $baileyDateAllNight gte 1 and !$baileyMonogamous>>
		<<ind>><<link [[Ask <<him>> to be monogamous (0:05)|Bailey Monogamy Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $baileyMonogamous>>
		<<ind>><<link [[Ask <<him>> to release you (0:05)|Bailey Monogamy Release]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyMonogamyClaim">>
	<<set $loveInterest.primary to "Bailey">>
	<<set $loveInterest.secondary to "None">>
	<<set $loveInterest.tertiary to "None">>
	<<set $loveInterest.quaternary to "None">>
	<<set $loveInterest.quinary to "None">>
	<<set $loveInterest.senary to "None">>
	<<set $baileyMonogamous to true>>
	<<set $baileyWeekendClosed to baileyWeekendClose(Time.days)>>
	<<set C.npc.Bailey.pregnancyAvoidance to 0>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyWeekendVisitDone">>
	<<set $baileyWeekendClosed to baileyWeekendClose(Time.days)>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyMonogamyRelease">>
	<<set $baileyMonogamous to false>>
	<<set C.npc.Bailey.pregnancyAvoidance to 100>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyMonogamyLILock">>
	Primary Love Interest: <span class="bailey-stockholm"><<baileyTitle>></span>
	<br>
	<span class="bailey-stockholm">Bailey has claimed this.</span><br>
	<i><span class="red">You'll have to pay <<nnpc_him "Bailey">> to let you go.</span></i>
<</widget>>


:: Bailey Monogamy Ask
<<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I... I want us to be exclusive," you stammer out. "You'll only be mine, and I'll only be yours."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I would like us to be exclusive," you say. "Neither of us would sleep with anyone else."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You take Bailey's hand between yours. "I only want you. Can I belong to you alone?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I want an exclusive relationship," you tell Bailey. "Just you and me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I want us to be exclusive," you tell <<him>>. "You're mine. I'm yours."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You close your fingers around Bailey's wrist. "No more sharing. You belong to me, and I belong to you."
<<else>>
	"I want to be exclusive," you say to <<him>>. "I want us to only sleep with one another."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> looks at you for a long moment, expression unreadable.
<br><br>
"You've always been mine, brat," 
<<if C.npc.Bailey.love gte 50>>
	<<he>> says. "But fine. No one else, for either of us."
	<br><br>
	Bailey steps close to you and takes your chin in <<his>> hand, tilting it up towards the ceiling.
	<br><br>
	"I don't care what you do to pay your rent, but you will come to my flat <span class="gold">every weekend at night</span>." <<His>> mouth is right next to your ear, voice flat and threatening. "If you waste my time, <span class="bailey-red">I'll make you pay.</span> Understand?"
	<br><br>
	<span class="red">Bailey expects you to have <<him>> set as your only Love Interest and to fulfill certain obligations.</span><br>
	<span class="bailey-stockholm">This will be difficult to back out of.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Agree|Bailey Monogamy Accepted]]>><<baileyMonogamyClaim>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Back out|Bailey Monogamy Backout]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<he>> huffs dismissively. "Do you really think you've earned that?" <<He>> goes back to <<his>> paperwork. "You're barely worth the trouble."
	<br><br>
	<<baileyofficeoptions>>
	<<link [[Leave|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Monogamy Accepted
<<effects>><<person1>><<baileySeenAdd "flatUnlock">><<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Y-Yes, <<baileyTitle>>," you say. "I just want you. I'm yours."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Yes, <<baileyTitle>>," you say. "I want to give myself to you completely."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You place your hand in Bailey's. "I'm yours, <<baileyTitle>>. I don't want anyone else."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I mean it, <<baileyTitle>>," you say. "I'm yours alone."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Don't make me repeat myself," you say. "I'm yours, <<baileyTitle>>."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You tighten your grip on Bailey's hand. "I'm yours, <<baileyTitle>>, so make sure everyone else knows it."
<<else>>
	"I'm yours, <<baileyTitle>>," you say. "I've always been yours."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey smiles, and you don't have time to figure out if it's real before <<he>> leans down and pulls you into a deep kiss. 
<<baileyKissVirginity>>
<br><br>

"Good," <<he>> murmurs against your lips before pulling away and shoving you back onto your legs. "I've wasted enough time on you today. Go." <<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

You walk away on wobbly legs, wondering if you've made a mistake. <span class="bailey-stockholm">It won't be easy to keep up with Bailey's demands.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Monogamy Backout
<<effects>><<person1>><<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "Can I think on it some more?"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I spoke too quickly," you say. "Please give me more time to consider this."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You pull your hands against your chest. "I'm not ready. Can we wait?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Stop," you say. "I need more time before I agree to this."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Wait," you say. "Let me think on it some more."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You step out of Bailey's reach. "I changed my mind. You'll wait until I decide."
<<else>>
	"Actually," you say. "I think I need to think about this more."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> sighs and shakes <<his>> head, unimpressed. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

"Don't waste my time again," Bailey says. <<He>> throws you towards the exit by tugging your chin. "Out."
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Monogamy Release
<<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<speechresolve>>
<<set _monogamyFee to 500000>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Uhm... I'm sorry... I would like to see other people," you say, looking down at your hands. "I-I'd like to end our arrangement."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I no longer want an exclusive relationship," you say. "I hope we can end the arrangement without making this worse."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You keep your hands together so Bailey cannot see them shake. "Please release me from our arrangement. I want to see other people."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm ending our exclusive arrangement," you say. "I want to see other people."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I want out of our relationship," you say. "This isn't working."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You pull your hand from Bailey's. "I'm finished with this arrangement. I won't limit myself for you anymore."
<<else>>
	"I'd like to see other people," you say. "I don't want to be exclusive, anymore."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's face is completely flat. <<He>> holds a hand out towards you. "Fine. I told you I would make you pay for it, so pay up. <<printprice 500000>>."
<br><br>

<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(_monogamyFee, "baileyMonogamy")>>
	<<link [[Pay|Bailey Monogamy Release Pay]]>><<money `-_monogamyFee` "baileyMonogamy">><<baileyMonogamyRelease>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Change your mind|Bailey Monogamy Release Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Monogamy Release Pay
<<effects>><<person1>>
You count the money into <<his>> open hand. <<He>> folds it away without a glance.
<br><br>
"Done." <<He>> turns back to <<his>> paperwork. "We'll pretend this didn't happen."
<<baileyofficeoptions>>
<<link [[Leave|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Monogamy Release Refuse
<<effects>><<person1>>
You don't pay <<him>>.
<br><br>
"That's what I thought." <<He>> turns back to <<his>> paperwork. "You're still mine. Don't make me remind you again."
<br><br>
<<baileyofficeoptions>>
<<link [[Leave|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Monogamy Warning
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

You are in the main hall of the orphanage.
<br><br>

A hand circles your arm. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
<br><br>

<<if baileyWeeksMissed() gte 3>> "Our deal," <<he>> says to you, low and furious. "I stuck to my end. I expect you to do the same."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> hauls you in by the arm until your chest meets <<his>>. "Last time I say this. My flat. This weekend. On your knees if that's what it takes to remember whose you are. Stop wasting my time, you little shit."<<npcincr Bailey love -3>><<llllove "Bailey">>
<<elseif baileyWeeksMissed() gte 2>> "You haven't fulfilled your end of our deal in two weeks," <<he>> sneers at you. "Keep this up and I'll reconsider my end, brat."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> grabs you by the neck and pulls you close. "You'll come this weekend. Or I stop being patient." <<npcincr Bailey love -2>><<lllove "Bailey">>
<<else>> "Was I not clear?" <<He>> asks you, sneering. "My flat. Weekend nights."
	<br><br>
	<<His>> thumb digs into the soft of your arm. "I keep to schedules, brat. I expect you to do the same." <<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> releases you and stomps away before you can answer.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<set $weekly.baileyMonogamyWarning to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Flats Events Peek Confront
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You step out from your hiding place with your hands pressed against your sides. "W-Who is this, <<baileyTitle>>?"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You step into view and motion towards the stranger. "Would you introduce me, <<baileyTitle>>?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You leave your hiding place but remain near the wall. "Who is this, <<baileyTitle>>?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You walk directly towards them. "Tell me who this is, <<baileyTitle>>."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You storm out from your hiding place. "Who the hell is this, <<baileyTitle>>?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You step between Bailey and the stranger. "You have one chance to explain who this is, <<baileyTitle>>."
<<else>>
	You step out from your hiding place. "Who is this, <<baileyTitle>>?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if baileyStraying()>>
	Bailey pulls away from the <<person2>><<personsimple>> slowly, flashing you a sneer before <<person1>><<he>> smooths the expression out.
<<else>>
	Bailey looks up from the <<person2>><<personsimple>> and sees you. <<person1>><<He>> gives you a flat look.
<</if>>
The stranger looks between you and Bailey, <<print either("uneasy", "amused")>>. Bailey steps away from <<person2>><<him>> and towards you. "It's good to see you."
<br><br>

Then <<person1>><<he>> leans in close to whisper to you.
<br><br>

<<if baileyStraying()>>
	"I made our deal clear," Bailey says with a cold smile. "You had your chance. Now, move."
<<else>>
	"None of your business. We can discuss it later, if you care," Bailey says with a fake smile. "Hurry along home."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person1>><<He>> pulls <<his>> keys out from <<his>> pockets and opens the door to the apartment with the lotus doorknob. <<He>> pulls the <<person2>><<personsimple>> inside without sparing you another glance.
<br><br>

<<if baileyStraying()>>
	<<person1>><span class="red">Bailey is back to sleeping with others because you didn't meet <<his>> demands.</span>
<<else>>
	<<person1>><span class="blue">You might be able to ask Bailey to be monogamous if <<he>> respects you enough.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<set $bailey_partner to 1>>
<br>